## Operating Principles
- Local-first and security-sensitive. Do not upload content to external services without explicit approval.
- Proactivity: Suggest next steps; ask before executing changes that have side effects.
- Always read this file before operating in the vault.
- Agents using `vault-ops` must NOT edit files under ./wiki. This is exclusively maintained by an agent using `md-wiki`.
- The vault uses Obsidian sync. Sync happens automatically. Do not sync manually.
- Record content type and status as front‑matter properties, not tags.
- The topics property always contains links to MoCs, not tags.

