## Note Types
Reuse templates from skill/references: note-template, moc-template
| Type    | Usage | Maintainer | Template |
| ------- | ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------ | -------------------------- | ------------------- |
| zettel  | Atomic note from external source — thread extraction, research summary, resource digestion | Agent                      | note-template       |
| moc     | Map of Content hub page                                                                    | Agent                      | moc                 |
| article | Distilled synthesis, analysis, or narrative — the user's own thinking                      | User with agent assistance | article             |
